{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--nankor-na-necessative-soft-imperative","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity"],"statement":{"en":"The combination nankor na indicates necessity and functions as a soft imperative.","ja":"nankor na は必要性を表し、穏やかな命令として機能する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor na"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0196-06","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0197-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--nankor-na-predicate-retains-pronominal-affix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity"],"statement":{"en":"Unlike in ordinary imperative constructions, a predicate retains its pronominal affixes in the necessative nankor na construction.","ja":"通常の命令構文とは異なり、義務（必然）を表す nankor na 構文では述語に付加された代名詞接辞が保持される。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["nankor na"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0196-07","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0197-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--nankor-na-necessative-soft-imperative","differs_in":null,"note":"Retention of pronominal agreement morphology distinguishes the nankor na necessative soft imperative from canonical imperative syntax."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--kuni-expresses-necessative-mood-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kuni-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The necessative mood may be expressed by the form kuni in Shizunai Ainu.","ja":"静内方言において、義務法（必然法）は kuni という形式によっても表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0198-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--yoki-h-indicates-the-speaker-s-expectation-that","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity"],"statement":{"en":"Yoki-hō indicates the speaker's expectation that something should naturally or necessarily be so.","ja":"予期法は「当然（又は必然）……の筈」という話者の期待を示す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0193-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-auxiliary-easirki-expresses-deontic-obligation-must-have","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--easirki"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary easirki expresses deontic obligation ('must / have to') and is predominantly attested in Saru Ainu, with examples also in Horobetsu Ainu.","ja":"助動詞 easirki は「〜しなければならない」という意味を表し、用例のほとんどは沙流方言であるが幌別方言の例もある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/southwest/horobetsu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["easirki"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0305-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-light-noun-construction-kun-i-p-expresses","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kuni-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The light noun construction kun-i-p expresses deontic modality ('should').","ja":"形式名詞構造kun-i-pは義務的モダリティ（「べき」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kun-i-p"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-auxiliary-kuni-should-ought-to-does-not","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kuni-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary kuni 'should, ought to' does not occur at sentence-final position.","ja":"助動詞 kuni「〜すべきである、〜するはずである」は文末には現れない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-southern-hokkaido-ainu-auxiliary-kus-ne-going","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"The Southern Hokkaido Ainu auxiliary kus-ne 'going to/intend to' derives from kusu 'intention (?)' followed by the copula ne.","ja":"南北海道アイヌ語の助動詞 kus-ne「〜するつもりだ／〜するだろう」は、kusu「意図 (?)」と係辞 ne から派生したものである。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus-ne","kusu","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0022-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-u-ne-expresses-intention-in-the-first","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"kus(u)-ne expresses intention in the first person.","ja":"kus(u)-ne は第一人稱における意志を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["with first-person subjects"]},"forms":["kusu-ne","kus-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0208-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-u-ne-expresses-prospective-aspect-or-future","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"kus(u)-ne expresses prospective aspect or future.","ja":"kus(u)-ne は將然態或は未來を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu-ne","kus-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0209-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--from-the-expression-of-intention-kus-u-ne","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"From the expression of intention, kus(u)-ne comes to be used as a gentle command toward the second person.","ja":"意志の表示から kus(u)-ne は第二人稱に對する柔かき命令となる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["toward second person"]},"forms":["kusu-ne","kus-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0209-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-auxiliary-phrase-kusu-ne-kus-ne-expresses","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary phrase kusu ne (kus ne) expresses 'intend to ~' or 'it is decided/turns out that ~'.","ja":"助動詞的連語 kusu ne (kus ne) は「〜するつもりだ，〜することになる」を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu ne","kus ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0103-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-idiomatic-expression-kus-ne-or-kusu-ne","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"The idiomatic expression kus ne (or kusu ne), consisting of kus 'purpose' and ne 'copula', expresses that something is scheduled/intended to happen ('be supposed to do').","ja":"kus ne（kusu ne とも言う）は「〜することになっている」という意味を表す熟語的表現である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus ne","kusu ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0140-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/deontic-necessity--the-volitional-future-auxiliary-construction-kus-ne-has","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topics":["topic:tam/deontic-necessity","topic:tam/deontic-necessity--kus-ne-deontic"],"statement":{"en":"The volitional/future auxiliary construction kus ne has an alternate pronunciation kusu ne.","ja":"意志・未来を表す kus ne には kusu ne という発音もある。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus ne","kusu ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0208-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
